1
00:00:00,643 --> 00:00:04,023
(Penny:)Hey, guys. Sorry you had to wait,
but we are swamped.

2
00:00:04,188 --> 00:00:05,478
(Penny:)What's this?

3
00:00:05,648 --> 00:00:07,188
(Leonard:)Sheldon took our order.

4
00:00:07,358 --> 00:00:09,698
(Penny:)Sheldon doesn't work here.

5
00:00:10,569 --> 00:00:12,029
(Leonard:)Well, honey, not to complain...

6
00:00:12,196 --> 00:00:14,866
(Leonard:)...but we were starting to think
you didn't either.

7
00:00:15,241 --> 00:00:16,281
[DISHES SHATTER]

8
00:00:17,868 --> 00:00:19,868
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)Is that really necessary?

9
00:00:21,288 --> 00:00:24,168
(Sheldon:)Good Lord.

10
00:00:24,375 --> 00:00:26,625
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)The interference pattern
in the fracture.

11
00:00:27,461 --> 00:00:29,841
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)The motion of the wave
through the structure.

12
00:00:30,006 --> 00:00:31,886
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)I've been looking at it all wrong.

13
00:00:32,091 --> 00:00:34,511
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)I can't consider
the electrons as particles.

14
00:00:34,677 --> 00:00:36,847
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)They move through the graphene
as a wave.

15
00:00:38,597 --> 00:00:41,187
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)It's a wave!

16
00:00:42,727 --> 00:00:45,897
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)The moment to applaud would be now.

17
00:00:47,565 --> 00:00:49,605
(Sheldon(drops tray. A nearby table claps):)Troglodytes.

18
00:00:50,317 --> 00:00:53,237
(Penny:)Sheldon. Where are you going?
Aren't you gonna clean this?

19
00:00:53,404 --> 00:00:58,024
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, I don't work here.

